type: software
title: "RadarSim: Physics-Based Radar Simulation and Signal Processing"
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-20
url: "https://github.com/SpaceEngineerSS/RadarSim"
repository-code: "https://github.com/SpaceEngineerSS/RadarSim"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - radar
  - simulation
  - pulse-doppler
  - ecm
  - cfar
  - target-tracking
authors:
  - name: "RadarSim Contributors"
abstract: >-
  RadarSim is a physics-based radar simulation engine implementing
  pulse-Doppler processing, CFAR detection, Swerling RCS models,
  ITU-R P.676 atmospheric attenuation, electronic countermeasures,
  radar tracking and fusion, receiver limiting, electronic
  countermeasures, and SAR/ISAR imaging. It is intended for
  reproducible engineering studies and education.
